      "name": "PerformBnetLogin",
      "signature": "int PerformBnetLogin(int nLoginContext, int nValidateCredentials, int nAccountOperation)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Performs Battle.net login sequence with optional credential validation and account operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Check BNClient interface availability via vtable offset 0x74\n  2. If interface unavailable, display error string 0x14e3 and return failure\n  3. If already logged in (g_bBnetLoggedIn != 0), log warning and return success\n  4. Initialize login UI via FUN_6fa77550\n  5. Get login status via vtable offset 0x28\n  6. If nValidateCredentials is TRUE and credentials not yet validated:\n     a. Call credential validation via vtable offset 0x60\n     b. Poll via PollBnetLoginCredentialValidation until complete\n     c. If failed (g_dwGameStateFlags != 0), cleanup and return failure\n     d. Finalize validation via vtable offset 0x64\n  7. If nAccountOperation is non-zero and validation succeeded:\n     a. Process account operation based on nAccountOperation value\n     b. Call HandleBnetConnectionError and return failure if error\n  8. Check BNClient connection status via vtable offset 0x74\n  9. If connected, perform actual login via vtable offset 0x8\n  10. Poll login status via PollBnetLoginStatus until complete\n  11. If successful, set g_bBnetLoggedIn = 1 and return TRUE\n  12. Otherwise handle connection error and return FALSE\n\nParameters:\n  nLoginContext (ECX)         - Login context structure address\n  nValidateCredentials (EDX)  - TRUE (1) to validate credentials first\n  nAccountOperation (Stack)   - Account operation type (0=none, 1=normal, 2-8=account ops)\n\nReturns:\n  1 (TRUE)  - Login successful, g_bBnetLoggedIn set to 1\n  0 (FALSE) - Login failed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns 1 immediately if already logged in (warning logged)\n  - Returns 0 if BNClient interface is not available\n  - Error codes 0xf-0x16 map to account operation failures",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:e997da64fc17b55935e00a5d2e84c05c",
