      "name": "ShowTitleMessageButtonDialog",
      "signature": "void ShowTitleMessageButtonDialog(Unicode * pszMessage, uint dwBufferSize, void * pDisconnectHandler)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "ShowTitleMessageButtonDialog - Displays a modal dialog with title, message text, and optional buttons.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dispatch all pending control handlers to clear queue (g_nPendingControlHandlerCount)\n2. Create and initialize title control from factory type DAT_6fa92170\n3. Create textbox control from factory type DAT_6fa921a0\n4. Create separator control from factory type DAT_6fa921d0\n5. Initialize 2048-byte Unicode string buffer [ESP+0x14] for text processing\n6. Copy message text into buffer using Unicode::strncpy(buffer, pszMessage, 0x400)\n7. Parse message text by newline delimiter (L'\n' = 0x000A):\n   - Iterate through buffer scanning for newline characters\n   - Replace each newline with null terminator (L'\\0')\n   - Extract text segment between delimiters\n   - Call TextBoxAddText to add segment to textbox\n8. Test pButtonText (loaded from unaffected register EBP) for NULL/empty:\n9. If NULL (CMP EBP, 0; JZ branch):\n   - Create OK button (single button path)\n   - Store in pending handlers array\n10. If non-NULL (else branch):\n   - Create YES button, parse and add button text\n   - Create NO button (CreateSubControl(0xE9)), add text\n   - Call FUN_6fa76cc0 to configure button with callback\n11. Store pDisconnectHandler (from stack) in global g_pBnetDisconnectHandler\n12. Cleanup: pop registers, restore stack, return\n\nParameters:\n  pszMessage (ECX - __fastcall): Unicode string with embedded newlines; copied to local buffer\n  dwBufferSize (EDX): Buffer capacity in bytes (typically 0x400 = 1024 bytes for 512 wchar_t)\n  pDisconnectHandler (stack param): Callback function pointer invoked on disconnect event\n\nReturns:\n  void (no return value; all state changes are global)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:270251c06d38865b9fe7d5990a73d283",
