      "comment": "Initializes the Battle.net login UI screen by creating and configuring UI objects.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call pre-initialization routine (FUN_6fa85070)\n2. Create and add UI objects to global array (max 64 objects)\n   - Object 0: Type DAT_6fa92980\n   - Object 1: Type DAT_6fa929b0 (animated image, cel-based)\n   - Object 2: Type DAT_6fa928f0 \n   - Object 3: Type DAT_6fa92920 (text box with string 0x143a)\n   - Object 4: Type DAT_6fa928c0 (text box with string 0x143b)\n   - Object 5: Type DAT_6fa929e0\n3. For each object creation:\n   - Validate array bounds (g_dwUIObjectCount < 64)\n   - Call CreateObjectByTypeFactory() with template\n   - Store pointer in global array g_pUIObjectArray\n   - Increment g_dwUIObjectCount counter\n   - Call FatalErrorExit on overflow\n4. Configure cel-based image (0x6fa97c90):\n   - Call SetImageDataType() to set image data\n   - Validate cel image type\n   - Initialize cel frame count\n5. Add text to text boxes:\n   - Validate string IDs (0x143a, 0x143b)\n   - Retrieve string pointers via ValidateStringId()\n   - Call TextBoxAddText() with string and display flags\n6. Convert cel animation timing:\n   - Get frame count from cel image\n   - Call undocumented function FUN_6fa8547c with frame data\n   - Convert timing to ASCII \u2192 Unicode format\n   - Apply to banner/marquee object (0x6fa97c8c)\n\nParameters:\nNone. Function operates on global state: g_pUIObjectArray, g_dwUIObjectCount, g_pBnclientInterface\n\nReturns:\nvoid. Side effects: Modifies global UI array, creates 6 UI objects, sets g_dwUIObjectCount\n\nError Handling:\n- Asserts if g_dwUIObjectCount >= 64 before each object creation\n- Calls FatalErrorExit(-1) on array overflow\n- No error recovery; errors terminate program\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x3f (63): Maximum UI object count - 1\n- 0x60d (1549): Line number in source (D2Launcher)\n- 0x143a, 0x143b: String resource IDs for login text\n- 0x4c: Offset into BnClient interface for query function\n- 0x51eb851f: Magic constant for frame time calculation (IMUL scale factor)\n\nStructure Layout:\nUI Object Array (global):\n- g_pUIObjectArray: Array of up to 64 pointers to UI objects\n- g_dwUIObjectCount: Current number of objects in array\n- g_pBnclientInterface: BnClient vtable with query at offset 0x4c\n- g_szConfigPath (0x6fa92b34): Source directory for ascii\u2192unicode conversion\n- g_pBanner (0x6fa97c90): Cel-based animated image object\n- g_pLoginForm (0x6fa97c8c): Background/marquee object\n\nRemarks:\nThe function prepares the login UI by constructing a scene with animated background and text labels. The mysterious FUN_6fa8547c appears to handle timing data conversion for animation. String IDs 0x143a/0x143b refer to account login prompts in the resource strings.",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
