      "name": "InitializeGameMenus",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameMenus(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "InitializeGameMenus - Reconstruct the battle.net menus after disconnection/reconnection.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Disconnect from battle.net and reset control handler at index 0x53\n2. Clear UI cache (FUN_6fa85070)\n3. Check if Expansion MPQ is available (MPQ mode selection)\n4. Branch on MPQ availability:\n   - NO MPQ: Create character screen, main menu, intro screens in base game sequence\n   - WITH MPQ: Create character screen, main menu (expansion version), intro screens in expansion sequence\n5. Conditionally disable menu buttons if Expansion character present (IsCharExpansionPresent)\n6. Create final UI objects: music player, version display, mode indicators, and event markers\n7. Call bnet interface virtual method at offset 0x5c to finalize bnet state\n8. Format and display version string with music options\n9. Initialize music tracks if music enabled\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nControl Flow:\n- Expansion check at 0x6fa77bce (CheckExpansionMpqExists)\n- Branch TRUE: Standard game menus (no expansion) via 0x6fa77cf7\n- Branch FALSE: Expansion game menus (expansion present) via 0x6fa77d19\n- Both paths merge at 0x6fa77e09 for common finalization\n\nCritical Data Accesses:\n- g_aPendingControlHandlers[0x53]: Disconnect flag\n- g_aPendingControlHandlers[0x45]: Main menu UI object pointer\n- g_dwUIObjectCount: Current UI object array index (max 0x40)\n- g_pUIObjectArray[index]: UI object storage array\n- g_pBnclientInterface: Battle.net client interface vtable\n\nDAT_* Parameters to CreateObjectByTypeFactory:\n- 0x6fa8fa10: Character screen (no expansion)\n- 0x6fa8f890: Character screen (no expansion, alt)\n- 0x6fa8f8c0: Main menu (no expansion)\n- 0x6fa8f9e0: Main menu (expansion)\n- 0x6fa8fa40: Intro screens (expansion)\n- 0x6fa8f9b0: Intro screens (expansion, alt)\n- 0x6fa8f920: Version display\n- 0x6fa8f950: Mode indicators\n- 0x6fa8f980: Event markers\n- 0x6fa92950: Music player\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x32: Control handler field offset for disconnect flag\n- 0x40 (64): Maximum UI objects in g_pUIObjectArray\n- 0x5c: Virtual method offset for bnet interface finalization\n- 0x60d: Line number for assertion checks\n- 0x966: Line number for bnet interface null check\n- 0x20: Version string buffer size\n\nState Transitions:\n- Pre-disconnect state -> DisconnectFromBnet() -> Menu reconstruction -> Post-reconnect state\n- Menu type determined by MPQ availability (base game vs expansion)\n- Expansion character detection controls button activation\n\nError Handling:\n- FogAssert called if g_dwUIObjectCount exceeds 0x40 (buffer overflow prevention)\n- FatalErrorExit(-1) called on assertion failures\n- FatalErrorExit(-1) called if g_pBnclientInterface is NULL\n\nDependencies:\n- DisconnectFromBnet: Terminates active battle.net connection\n- CheckExpansionMpqExists: Determines game mode (expansion vs base)\n- IsCharExpansionPresent: Checks if expansion character exists\n- CreateObjectByTypeFactory: Factory for UI menu objects\n- SetUnitBitMask: Disables menu buttons with dwMask=0\n- FUN_6fa7f9f0: Mystery UI initialization (called twice, expansion-specific)\n- GetMusicOptions: Retrieves music configuration\n- InitializeMusicTrackState: Sets music playback mode\n- StringAsciiToUnicode: Converts version string to wide characters",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:40398931a144860a0281e9276103df04",
