      "name": "InitializeUITextBoxContent",
      "signature": "int InitializeUITextBoxContent(Control * pControl)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initializes UI text box content based on control content state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if UI text box system is initialized (g_bUITextBoxInitialized == -1)\n2. Load control content flag from parameter offset 0xc\n3. If content flag is set: Clear and repopulate both text boxes\n   a. Clear text box handler [0x54] (first message box)\n   b. Validate string 0xfa7 and retrieve message text\n   c. Add message text to first text box\n   d. Clear text box handler [0x55] (second detail box)\n   e. Validate string 0x140a and retrieve detail text\n   f. Add detail text to second text box\n   g. Set pending flag (g_bUITextBoxPending = 4) to mark as updated\n4. Else if pending flag already set: Clear both text boxes\n5. Return success (1)\n\nParameters:\npControl (Control*): Control structure containing content flag at offset 0xc\n  - Offset 0xc: Content flag indicating if text update is needed\n\nReturns:\n1: Always returns success after processing",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
