      "name": "InitializeGameIntroAndResources",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameIntroAndResources(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes the game intro sequence and core game resources.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Process pending window messages (PeekMessageA loop)\n2. Determine display resolution mode based on CPU capabilities\n3. Copy resolution string to local buffer\n4. Get locale string ID\n5. Attempt to load intro video file from MPQ\n6. Dispatch initial graphics initialization\n7. Clear and reinitialize all UI object handlers\n8. Release existing game units and clear hash tables\n9. Create and register 5 core UI objects (game screens)\n10. Initialize palette data and compare sky vs fechar palettes\n11. Initialize ActPalette with generated palette files\n12. Check expansion pack MPQ existence\n13. Add intro text based on expansion status\n14. Initialize music system if audio is enabled\n\nParameters:\nvoid - Uses global game state and configuration\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Modifies global game state directly",
