      "comment": "Sets the global game state variable to 3 (typically game-in-progress state).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Write constant 0x3 to global game state variable at 0x6fa97908\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nNone (void)\n\nPurpose:\nThis is a specialized setter function that initializes or updates the game state to indicate the game is in a specific state (likely in-progress or active gameplay). Used during game initialization or state transitions.\n\nRelated:\n- SetGameState(dword dwState) at 0x6fa76310 is the generic parameterized version\n- g_dwGameState at 0x6fa97908 is the global state variable",
