      "name": "ValidateAndProcessGameResource",
      "signature": "void ValidateAndProcessGameResource(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Clears UI/game object handlers and reinitializes game resources.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call ProcessSlots() to handle pending slot operations\n2. Iterate UI objects, dispatch inventory item handlers, clear count\n3. Iterate game objects, dispatch inventory item handlers, clear count  \n4. Reset global configuration via SetGlobalConfig(0)\n5. If palette reinitialization flag set, rebuild palette files\n6. Perform byte-by-byte comparison of palette data for validation\n7. Call ReleaseAllUnits() to clean up unit structures\n8. Call ClearHashTableAndCleanup() for hash table reset\n9. Call SetStoredValue(1) to persist state\n10. Call InitializeGameState() to reinitialize game state machine\n\nParameters:\nNone (void) - processes only global UI and game object arrays\n\nReturns:\nNone (void) - no return value, modifies global state\n\nNotes:\nStack allocation: 0x208 bytes (520) for two character buffers\nCalled during game initialization or resource reload sequence",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
