      "name": "InitializeButtonText",
      "signature": "void InitializeButtonText(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize button control text with formatted gateway name and string resource.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load BN client interface pointer from global (g_pBnclientInterface at 0x6fa96c64)\n2. Call interface method at offset 0xa4 to get gateway access structure\n3. Extract source string from structure offset 0xc\n4. Get gateway access account name via BNGatewayAccess::Name() helper\n5. Copy gateway name + source string to stack buffer via SStrCopy()\n6. Initialize three Unicode string buffers (512 chars each): aUStack_404, aUStack_204, format buffer\n7. Convert ASCII stack string to Unicode format in aUStack_404 via Unicode::toUnicode()\n8. Load string resource ID 0x2a5e via ValidateStringId()\n9. Copy resource string to Unicode buffer aUStack_204 via Unicode::strcpy()\n10. Clear format buffer with 0x40 dwords (256 bytes) via REP STOSD\n11. Format final string using sprintf(): destination = resource_string + account_unicode\n12. Convert all characters to uppercase using _toUpperTable lookup (chars < 0x100)\n13. Pass formatted text to InitButtonControl() for button control index 0x45\n\nParameters: None (void function, operates on global state only)\n\nReturns: void (modifies global button control state)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Uses large stack buffers (1024+ bytes total Unicode strings)\n- Character uppercase loop recalculates string length each iteration (inefficiency)\n- Only applies case conversion for Unicode chars < 0x100\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x100: 256 character buffer size constant\n- 0x2a5e: String resource identifier for button label template\n- 0x45: Button control handler index (69 decimal)\n- 0xa4: Offset into BN client interface structure\n- 0xc: Offset into gateway access structure for source string\n- 0x40: DWord count for buffer clear (256 bytes)\n- 0x6fa96c64: Global BN client interface pointer address\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeGameMenus (caller at 0x6fa77bb0): Initializes entire menu system\n- InitButtonControl: Applies formatted text to button control\n- ValidateStringId: Retrieves string from resource table\n- Unicode::toUnicode, sprintf, strlen: String manipulation helpers",
