      "comment": "Wrapper for InitializeGameMenus that returns success status.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call InitializeGameMenus() to initialize menu system\n2. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\n1 - Always returns success status\n\nSpecial Cases:\nThis is a thin wrapper around InitializeGameMenus(). If menu initialization fails, the failure is not propagated; this function always returns success.\n\nRelated Functions:\nInitializeGameMenus - The wrapped initialization function",
