      "comment": "Validates and processes a parameter value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load parameter from stack\n2. Test if parameter is NULL or zero\n3. If zero, call error handler\n4. If non-zero, process and return success code\n\nParameters:\n  param1: Parameter value to validate\n\nReturns:\n  EAX: 1 on success, 0 on failure/error condition\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If param1 is NULL or zero, calls error handler function\n  - Preserves EBX, EBP, ESI, EDI registers",
