      "name": "InitializeGameUI",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameUI(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes core game UI objects and data structures after cleanup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Cleans up and reinitializes game state\n2. Creates UI object type 8 (main UI container)\n3. Creates UI object type 6 (secondary UI panel)\n4. Creates UI object type 7 (tertiary UI component)\n5. Initializes sky palette from g_pPalettePl2Path\n6. Initializes locale-specific data (text, strings, regional settings)\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Relies on global palette path pointer (g_pPalettePl2Path) being initialized\n- Must be called after CleanupAndReinitializeGameState to ensure clean state\n- UI object IDs 6, 7, 8 are hardcoded constants for specific UI components\n\nCall Sequence:\nCalled by game initialization routines:\n  - ProcessBattleNetLogin\n  - InitializeGameBattleNetSettingsAndObjects\n  - InitializeGameMenus\n  - InitializeUIObjects\n  - HandleRealmCharacterError\n  - HandleCdKeyErrorReconnect\n  - InitializeBnetLoginUI\n\nDependencies:\n- CleanupAndReinitializeGameState: Resets game state\n- CreateUIObjectByTypeId: Creates UI components by type ID\n- InitializePaletteFromPath: Sets up color palette\n- InitializeLocaleSpecificData: Sets up locale strings/data",
