      "comment": "Opens file with read-only sharing permission (0x40).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call OpenFileWithPermissions with lpszFilePath, szMode, and FILE_SHARE_READ\n2. Return file handle\n\nParameters:\n- lpszFilePath (LPCSTR): Path to file\n- szMode (char*): File mode string (\"rb\", \"wt\", etc.)\n\nReturns:\n- FILE* on success, NULL on failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x40: FILE_SHARE_READ permission",
